{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Anth\u00e8se</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter a broken world. Become the hope of those who survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anth\u00e8se is an Action Light RPG adventure game, the fruit of a 4-month graduation project by a team of 11 passionate French students.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world where humanity has taken refuge on floating islands after a catastrophe called the Fracture, you play as 21-year-old Em\u00f6ke, a Flesh-forged Guardian with a troubled past, always accompanied by her faithful mount. Charged with protecting the last human strongholds, she is sent on a mission to an island threatened by a fearsome predator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077480/extras/image__4_.jpg?t=1749660684\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face savage enemies in a gameplay blending Mob Bashing and intense Boss Fights, explore a ruined universe marked by the scars of the past, and plunge into the heart of a conflict of ideologies that will shake your convictions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077480/extras/image__3_.jpg?t=1749660684\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of Em\u00f6ke in third-person view, whether you play with the Xbox controller, PlayStation or keyboard. In combat, alternate between precise dodging, hand-to-hand sword attacks and a ranged attack triggered by your mount. Use healing kits to recover life. Every battle demands responsiveness, resource management and a sense of timing to survive in a merciless world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077480/extras/image.jpg?t=1749660684\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3077480?t=1749660684","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077480/b69860369a985dcaf67dedb63b4302ad0efa88df/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749660684","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077480/6b4f6121fc0b1ea8d67779e1876c17f9ef1d87c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749660684","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077480/6b4f6121fc0b1ea8d67779e1876c17f9ef1d87c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749660684","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Anth\u00e8se</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter a broken world. Become the hope of those who survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anth\u00e8se is an Action Light RPG adventure game, the fruit of a 4-month graduation project by a team of 11 passionate French students.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world where humanity has taken refuge on floating islands after a catastrophe called the Fracture, you play as 21-year-old Em\u00f6ke, a Flesh-forged Guardian with a troubled past, always accompanied by her faithful mount. Charged with protecting the last human strongholds, she is sent on a mission to an island threatened by a fearsome predator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077480/extras/image__4_.jpg?t=1749660684\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face savage enemies in a gameplay blending Mob Bashing and intense Boss Fights, explore a ruined universe marked by the scars of the past, and plunge into the heart of a conflict of ideologies that will shake your convictions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077480/extras/image__3_.jpg?t=1749660684\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of Em\u00f6ke in third-person view, whether you play with the Xbox controller, PlayStation or keyboard. In combat, alternate between precise dodging, hand-to-hand sword attacks and a ranged attack triggered by your mount. Use healing kits to recover life. Every battle demands responsiveness, resource management and a sense of timing to survive in a merciless world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077480/extras/image.jpg?t=1749660684\" /></p>","developers":["Anth\u00e8se Dev."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077480/44f90953d139c1aa041ad4d23c704c153bf8396c/header.jpg?t=1749660684","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257151054,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151054/movie480.mp4?t=1749660679","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151054/movie_max.mp4?t=1749660679"},"name":"Anth\u00e8se Trailer Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257151054/cac073c897ddc1048436b72b2b990e6391da434a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749660679","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151054/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749660679","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151054/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749660679"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257145889,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145889/movie480.mp4?t=1749660681","max":"http://video.akamai.st